    "username": "godofprompt",
    "nickname": "God of Prompt",
    "text": "The plan moved out of plan mode.\n\nAnthropic's own advice for a big job now skips the mode: have Claude interview you until everything is covered, write a complete spec to a file, then start a fresh session to build from it.\n\nThe fresh session only knows what the file says, so the file has to cover the problem, the users and what done looks like.",
